	<name>Mandovi River — Authenticated Water Network & Centerline</name>
	<description>High-precision Mandovi River water boundary, mainstem centerline, and tributary network calibrated against Sentinel-1 SAR, Sentinel-2 NDWI, and FABDEM topography. Includes Aguada Bay, Chorao Island Channels, Cumbarjua Canal, Sinquerim River, and Britona Creek.</description>
